				{
					"id": 221071901,
					"content": "有一群圍在一起的小狗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071902
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 221071902,
					"content": "這，這是什麼壞徵兆，這是在說我的愛情已經到了盡頭嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志華"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071903,
					"content": "咦？可是那群小狗的關係看起來很好啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071904,
					"content": "那幾隻小狗我知道，確實關係不錯，而且常年都在一起玩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志華"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071905,
					"content": "看起來確實不錯，但是事實上…它們誰都沒有找到另一半。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志華"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071906,
					"content": "而且因為有同伴可以一起玩，它們也根本不在意這件事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志華"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071907,
					"content": "它們現在有機會去找另一半了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071908
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 221071908,
					"content": "#什麼意思？難道…{F#妳}{M#你}去把它們趕開了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志華"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071909,
					"content": "這，這樣的話，倒也不錯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志華"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071910,
					"content": "能借助外力從迷惘中脫身，去追尋自己的真愛…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志華"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071911,
					"content": "#太謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}了！我明白這個徵兆是什麼意思了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志華"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071912,
					"content": "綺命姐，我一定會…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "志華"
				}
